OL,3,S#######################################
OL,4,CBBC launches partnership with Met      
OL,5,COffice for weather coverage            
OL,6,GThe BBC has said it will offer more    
OL,7,Gregional, digital and 10-day weather   
OL,8,Gforecasts under a new partnership with 
OL,9,Gthe Met Office, which begins on        
OL,10,GThursday.                              
OL,12,FThe collaboration, announced last      
OL,13,Fyear, aims to bring together the Met   
OL,14,FOffice's weather and climate           
OL,15,Fintelligence with the BBC's journalism 
OL,16,Fand reach, the broadcaster said.       
